  "reflectionText": "Come, they said, let us build a tower whose top reaches to the heavens, and make a name for ourselves, lest we be scattered. God came down to see what the children of man had built. Then he confused their language. What is it to build a tower meant to keep you from being scattered, and to find that the building of it is the very thing that breaks the gathering?",
